maya-benchmark 1
# The stream workload (#1064, docs/performance.md#stream): a generated 16 × 16 world of 128 m cells, 2,000
# entities each (512,000 in all), crossed back and forth 10 times at 60 m/s through the middle of a row,
# with W1's streaming radii (#1060). Each frame streams, then runs one tick; nothing is drawn.
name "stream"
workload stream
grid 16
count 2000
seed 990
speed 60
radii 640 384 64
cycles 10
runs 1
